          "subject": "Ukraine Conflict",
          "summary": "The Ukraine conflict is an ongoing international armed conflict between Russia and Ukraine, rooted in Russia’s 2014 occupation of Crimea and the subsequent fighting in eastern Ukraine, and greatly expanded by Russia’s full-scale armed attack beginning on 24 February 2022. It has involved long-range strikes, ground combat, occupation of parts of Ukrainian territory, major civilian harm and displacement, and international diplomatic and legal responses.",
